{"server":"cn","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_06_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_06","title":"黄金三角","storyCode":"GT-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"447c721083fe6d03d0762fd45850f0bb39cb5c6c5843e3155170fcb9df83b14b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"格拉尼选择主动献出血液开启宝藏，并拖着斯卡蒂帮村庄解决了游荡的赏金猎人。大鲍勃也在分得剩下的宝藏后，得以远走哥伦比亚。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，果然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"鲍勃！你，你在流血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不能在这里白白流血！我还能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"鲍勃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我们流过的血还少吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"还要打吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我们为了活命而战斗，为什么要在战斗中送命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我不够强，我认命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"鲍勃，抱歉......没有这箱宝藏，我们的村子就完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"离那箱东西远一点。把钥匙交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，呜?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"在你用那把钥匙打开宝箱的一瞬间，你会没命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是家里历代流传的贵重物品，父亲说我们最重要的职责之一就是要负责保管这枚钥匙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——钥匙使用后会割破你的手，吸走你的血。如果不是你这样的库兰塔人的血的话，钥匙就毁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"把钥匙给我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，这是村子里的所有人的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都是真的吗，斯卡蒂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"藏匿了骑士宝藏的人，为了守护骑士的秘密，不择手段。只有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"——只有来自卡西米尔的血脉才能破除所有的阻碍。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"“只有来自不惧牺牲，无畏艰险的卡西米尔血脉才能破除所有的阻碍。”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然也知道可能会要付出一些代价，但没有想到结果会是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"为了村子的所有人，我也早就做好觉悟了。我必须打开这个箱子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼，如果我出了意外，请把这些宝藏换来的钱带回给村民们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，父亲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"诶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔。能把钥匙给我看看吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"这个钥匙也不是很大不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然它不大，但是它吸走的血液量，一般人恐怕撑不住——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这个怪物钥匙，吸走的血是有限的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我来打开箱子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？可是这样一来，格拉尼你就。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉了，可萝尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂啊，如果我晕过去了的话，请接住我的身体哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼你快住手！别这么做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_med"},{"type":"narration","text":"数日后\n晴 \\ 能见度 12公里\n赏金猎人营地外"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们是......你们竟然还敢回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"集合！所有人都给我过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"真是麻烦，为什么我要来帮忙处理这些赏金猎人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，既然你得到了钥匙，就要帮我做这件事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"其实之前只要有你在的，也就不用雇佣其他的人来帮助村子了不是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。明明不关我的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"人数不少。才刚捡回一条命的你，能对付得过来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不是还有你在吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac01_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"动作快点。我赶着回罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那么动手吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔还在等我们呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，最后还是没能帮上忙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，村子里的人也害怕感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"这些事情只有我们自己知道就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"总之,谢谢你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你和格拉尼做这个决定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"所以这个事情终于告一段落了吗，我要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"诶，等等我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，可萝尔！我们先回村子吧，村子还有好多事情需要我帮忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，鲍勃大叔，要保重身体！需要治疗的时候，记得来罗德岛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"小个子，等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"这枚金币，接好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我会好好珍惜这份纪念品的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"数月后\n【大鲍勃的信件】\n敬启。\n我是鲍勃。\n我正在哥伦比亚的一处偏僻的庄园里，给你写下这封信。\n大家都过得很好。感染者的身份还是有些不便，但阳光下的生活，比想象中还要美好。\n多亏那个叫可萝尔的小姑娘和格拉尼在修缮完村子后，决定把多余的宝藏都留给我，我才能够顺利给这批弟兄们安居。\n我们已经可以自给自足了，甚至还打算试种啤酒花。\n这多亏了滴水村的那笔宝藏。\n那是一个有趣的故事，十分有趣。不是应该潦草地写在信里的故事。\n我稍微改变了一点想法。\n而我知道，你很早就有了自己的想法，整合运动并不是感染者唯一的归宿。\n你一定可以做出你自己的选择。\n我很想念你，希望能在哥伦比亚见到你。\n鲍勃\n致   泥岩"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"那真是太好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动"]},{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
